#: includes/user-capabilities-view.php:231
msgid "Inherited Group Permissions"
msgstr "Унаследованные групповые разрешения"

#: includes/user-capabilities-view.php:232
msgid ""
"Extra roles and specific permissions assigned to this user's active groups, "
"including WordPress role groups. These assignments are managed on the group."
